{"repositoryId":1406280915,"availability":"available","full":"lastreload/mnemonic-proxy","name":"mnemonic-proxy","description":"Like Johnny, your local agent carries more than its head can hold — and keeps working for hours. Transparent proxy: verbatim archive, structured recall, segments, saved engine state.","category":"Developer tools","language":"Python","stars":12,"forks":4,"created":"2026-10-05T19:22:05Z","updated":"2026-10-19T14:43:48Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://lastreload.github.io/mnemonic-proxy/","topics":["claude-code","codex","coding-agents","context-window","kv-cache","llama-cpp","llm","local-llm","mcp","proxy"],"demo":"https://lastreload.github.io/mnemonic-proxy/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:35.131Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:35.131Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:35.131Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-19T18:05:35.131Z","stars":12,"forks":4}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Like Johnny, your agent carries more than its head can hold — and keeps working for hours.","A transparent HTTP proxy that sits between a coding agent and a local model (llama.cpp's llama-server, Strata, ds4-server, or any OpenAI-compatible server). The agent keeps sending its whole, unmodified history; the proxy decides what the model actually reads. Old material leaves the prompt but is never summarized away: every message, tool call and output stays on disk, verbatim, and the model can pull any of it back.","It speaks OpenAI Chat Completions, Anthropic Messages and OpenAI Responses. Python ≥ 3.10, standard library only."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lastreload/mnemonic-proxy/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"62968a7cf1ae26899b39b07cacc52234962306f1e8d1d5c3c2f2356c91b04b5f","extractedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:35.225Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T18:05:35.225Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Like Johnny, your agent c